SUMMARY:Free Watch Party: Semi Finals Day 2 - Norway/England vs Argentina/Switzerland
DESCRIPTION:Last night\, one team punched its ticket to the Final. Tonight\, the other spot is up for grabs. The tension is real\, the stakes are everything\, and we wouldn’t watch it anywhere else but here with you. \nKickoff for this free event is at 2:00 p.m. \nFood and Beverage Concessions: Visit Franky’s for a gourmet hot dog or sausage\, and cool down with Frios Gourmet Pops. Non-alcoholic drinks from Coca-Cola as well as pre-packaged snacks can be purchased at the Community Partner Concessions Booth\, proceeds benefiting Levy Park and the event’s community partners. You can also stop by the park’s full-time concessionaires: Kind Ice Cream\, Hearsay\, and Gaspachos. \nActivities: Get into the tournament spirit with face and body art from Butterfly Faces\, Henna by Kenza\, try your hand at our bubble stations\, and enjoy coloring pages from featured teams. \nMerchandise: Event merchandise celebrating Houston\, Levy Park\, and the global soccer tournament will also be available for purchase. \nArt Installations and Photo Opportunities: Commemorate the experience with a photo tour of the park\, including life-sized soccer-themed photo backdrops and a tournament bracket. Visit our soccer ball music box and turn the crank for festive sounds.
URL:https://www.levyparkhouston.org/events/semifinals-2/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.levyparkhouston.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/I63A4610-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
