SUMMARY:Family Movie Night: Zootopia 2
DESCRIPTION:Experience the mystery and fun of Zootopia 2 at our free movie night! \nNo outside alcohol or furniture is allowed; park furniture will be available and alcohol can be purchased from park concessionaires. Visit Hearsay Levy Park\, Kind Ice Cream\, and Gaspachos Mexican Bites for food\, drinks\, and sweet treats for both you and your pet. \nAbout Zootopia 2 (PG): Detectives Judy Hopps and Nick Wilde investigate a mysterious reptile—Gary De’Snake—who threatens the mammal metropolis. To clear their names and crack the case\, the duo must go undercover and explore new\, unexpected parts of town where their partnership is tested
URL:https://www.levyparkhouston.org/events/family-movie-night-zootopia-2/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.levyparkhouston.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/FMN-Zootopia-2-scaled.png
END:VEVENT
